config MTK_ION_COMPAT
	tristate "Legacy MediaTek ION ABI on top of DMA-BUF"
	depends on DMA_SHARED_BUFFER && MMU
	help
	  Provides /dev/ion with the handle-based ION ioctl ABI of the
	  MediaTek Linux 4.19 vendor kernels, including the MediaTek
	  ION_IOC_CUSTOM commands, so that unmodified MediaTek Android
	  vendor blobs (gralloc, libion_mtk, libgralloc_extra) can allocate
	  and share buffers. Every heap is served from ordinary system pages
	  exported as standard dma-bufs, which any mainline driver can
	  import. Secure heaps are not secure.

	  If unsure, say N.
